{"code":"geocoach-argentinian-taxi","tips":[{"id":"geocoach-argentinian-taxi-105392","section":"Bariloche","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=RC72Z9J2YPlenvCTxu8KPQ&viewpoint=-41.13307990393461%2C-71.28498020785118&heading=21.69310488713094&pitch=-5.084584960669687","text":"Blue top.","countryCodes":["AR"],"sourceTagId":"105392"},{"id":"geocoach-argentinian-taxi-105393","section":"Buenos Aires","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=-6kAcPW5v-VfPzGtUrjm_w&viewpoint=-34.58321485702041%2C-58.40725976837454&heading=74.03333692894327&pitch=-8.973347921618753","text":"All pillars and roof are yellow. Second color is black.","countryCodes":["AR"],"sourceTagId":"105393"},{"id":"geocoach-argentinian-taxi-105394","section":"Comodoro","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=gQ_EFmt-rw74_g7q1j1ulA&viewpoint=-45.88331501261516%2C-67.54195580139722&heading=125.27935527345352&pitch=-8.27812972194505","text":"Car is completely white.","countryCodes":["AR"],"sourceTagId":"105394"},{"id":"geocoach-argentinian-taxi-105395","section":"Cordoba","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=Us8gpr92dmxfmOdPSlBN5A&viewpoint=-31.413425226418376%2C-64.20382081141084&heading=78.67029343288648&pitch=-4.758994790028822","text":"Entire car is yellow or light green. It also has black oval on it's side.","countryCodes":["AR"],"sourceTagId":"105395"},{"id":"geocoach-argentinian-taxi-105396","section":"Jujuy","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=EAr0ULy8mIjgE_8VKT-diw&viewpoint=-24.182690638860965%2C-65.30157606626184&heading=118.95019398975488&pitch=-3.6121679710439736","text":"Pillars aren't painted at all. Only the roof is yellow. Second color is black.","countryCodes":["AR"],"sourceTagId":"105396"},{"id":"geocoach-argentinian-taxi-105397","section":"La plata","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=-DgKNdkSbA0TNSgRcBAP3A&viewpoint=-34.92036255251936%2C-57.9556714701876&heading=24.840618304015763&pitch=-13.033178928714136","text":"Car has green line on it's side. If you are close enough, you will be able to see the city name.","countryCodes":["AR"],"sourceTagId":"105397"},{"id":"geocoach-argentinian-taxi-105398","section":"Mar del Plata","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=CRwX7DEw_2_7U1wbPMpOTw&viewpoint=-37.99921835967006%2C-57.54955016516191&heading=120.46098682222537&pitch=-5.238769068062041","text":"Looks like the one from jujui. All pillars are completely black. Only roof painted yellow. Howerer the city would feel bigger and have this lush coastal palms. Also it woudln't have any mountains around.","countryCodes":["AR"],"sourceTagId":"105398"},{"id":"geocoach-argentinian-taxi-105399","section":"Mendoza","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=8UKBzT_43XsdI8-nvsJQ5w&viewpoint=-32.88061101950835%2C-68.84205447280549&heading=271.330107809756&pitch=-4.360233729785904","text":"Looks like it was randomly painted. Roof, pillars, rear doors and both bumpers are yellow.","countryCodes":["AR"],"sourceTagId":"105399"},{"id":"geocoach-argentinian-taxi-105400","section":"Neuquen","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=GGGaCCjxUvUkqA6b0GykpA&viewpoint=-38.94868471296474%2C-68.0593473014478&heading=318.0993600720024&pitch=-6.632633977775228","text":"Entire car is yellow. Can look similar to the cordoba car, but this one doesn't have black oval and there is a 3-digit number on it's rear part.","countryCodes":["AR"],"sourceTagId":"105400"},{"id":"geocoach-argentinian-taxi-105401","section":"Rio Galleros","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=ZIuLjYKsB3ztMXwPq66lYA&viewpoint=-51.6306732061673%2C-69.22572860000172&heading=154.0075296358833&pitch=-23.117096579805207","text":"Rio Galleros car is like the one from Rosario, where only the A and C pillars are painted yellow. However here you can notice colder climat and most likely snow on the ground.","countryCodes":["AR"],"sourceTagId":"105401"},{"id":"geocoach-argentinian-taxi-105402","section":"Rosario","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=z-_mRosixybl7JzjUi0i2A&viewpoint=-32.962511170143046%2C-60.670734177110184&heading=337.18412629018184&pitch=-5.368921157831338","text":"A and C pillars and roof are painted yellow. B pillar and all other parts are black .","countryCodes":["AR"],"sourceTagId":"105402"},{"id":"geocoach-argentinian-taxi-105403","section":"Salta","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=6kBVdzLpF_CoA0fEVLrLcA&viewpoint=-24.78289591130817%2C-65.42283052176084&heading=232.09524140517868&pitch=-9.19307781012401","text":"Red car.","countryCodes":["AR"],"sourceTagId":"105403"},{"id":"geocoach-argentinian-taxi-105404","section":"San Juan","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=Ln3ts4hkXAmhLXegdRKMew&viewpoint=-31.533417182410055%2C-68.5144808394915&heading=156.49469100546378&pitch=-3.981626230877964","text":"White car with yellow roof.","countryCodes":["AR"],"sourceTagId":"105404"},{"id":"geocoach-argentinian-taxi-105405","section":"San Luis","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=dWdLfjPbqtXO7ceXtWTOQw&viewpoint=-33.307837028894035%2C-66.33605620117937&heading=166.9418505243513&pitch=-6.037630661460497","text":"Car has 2 thin light blue stripes on both sides.","countryCodes":["AR"],"sourceTagId":"105405"},{"id":"geocoach-argentinian-taxi-105406","section":"Santa Fe","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=iEFwSqnbVoiI3NLcooemqg&viewpoint=-31.615383862963096%2C-60.70546182524004&heading=149.8118047588625&pitch=-5.090141724272854","text":"Santa Fe taxi looks similar to the green one from Cordoba but with a lighter tint and a rectangle on its side.","countryCodes":["AR"],"sourceTagId":"105406"},{"id":"geocoach-argentinian-taxi-105407","section":"Santiago","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=BBmqfrIBsdK_K7DzTqnJHw&viewpoint=-